& [UserValue] is independently inspectable proof that a recorded attention admission account coheres with the evidence it describes
  + an agent can distinguish current verified admission historic account absence negative non-admission and evaluation evidence
  + a byte-valid but relationally false account fails closed

& [DependencyChain] is preserved source then SJS authority then pure validator then adversarial tests then isolated deployment then live evidence then closure

& [Deliverables] are versioned result boundary closed account validator cross-file binding tests deployment acceptance evidence and proof records

& [Exclusions] are inference replay exterior signature authentication truth judgment effect authorization and migration of archived evidence
